=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  logforward journald ------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Decided: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Debian 13$
# with journald alone, as Debian installs it: no syslog$
# forwarder. Set server would install rsyslog.$
$
# Log Forwarding ###############################################$
$
  [ ] Log Forwarding       Not Configured not forwarding$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
  [ ] Logger               journald alone no syslog forwarder$
   -  Server               None$
   -  hardn.yml            192.0.2.50:514 TCP$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Set server           Installs rsyslog$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

